# metaverse-systems/blockchain

## Requirements

- C++20 compiler (GCC 10+, Clang 12+)
- Boost (Asio, Serialization) >= 1.50
- OpenSSL
- Catch2 v3 (tests only)
- GNU Autotools (autoconf, automake)

## Building

```sh
autoreconf -fi
./configure
make
```

## Running Tests

```sh
make check
```

Or run the test binary directly:

```sh
./tests/blockchain_tests
```

## Usage

```sh
./src/blockchain <path-to-data-directory>
```

The data directory holds chain data, TLS certificates, and configuration. On first run a default `config.json` is generated:

```jsonc
{
  "tls": {
    "cert_file": "cert.pem",
    "key_file": "key.pem",
    "ca_file": ""
  },
  "network": {
    "rpc_port": 12345,
    "p2p_port": 12346,
    "timeout_seconds": 30
  },
  "consensus": { ... },
  "peers": {
    "seed_nodes": [],
    "max_outbound": 8,
    "max_inbound": 32,
    "exchange_interval_seconds": 30,
    "max_peers_stored": 256,
    "ban_duration_seconds": 86400,
    "ban_threshold_errors": 5,
    "reconnect_base_delay_seconds": 5,
    "reconnect_max_delay_seconds": 300,
    "discovery_enabled": true
  }
}
```

### TLS Setup

P2P connections require mutual TLS. Place `cert.pem`, `key.pem`, and optionally a CA file in the data directory (or provide absolute paths in `config.json`).

### Connecting Nodes

Add seed nodes to `config.json`:

```json
{
  "peers": {
    "seed_nodes": [
      { "host": "192.168.1.10", "port": 12346 }
    ]
  }
}
```

Or add peers at runtime via RPC:

```sh
curl -k https://localhost:12345 -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"addPeer","params":{"host":"192.168.1.10","port":12346}}'
```

## Project Structure

```
src/                    # Daemon source
  main.cpp              # Entry point
  NodeConfig.hpp/cpp    # config.json loader
  PeerManager.hpp/cpp   # Peer lifecycle management
  PeerConfig.hpp        # Peer data types
  Blockchain.hpp/cpp    # Chain storage
  Block.hpp/cpp         # Block type
  Chunk.hpp/cpp         # Chunked persistence
  ConsensusConfig.hpp   # Consensus parameters
  SyncState.hpp         # Sync progress tracking
  utils.hpp/cpp         # Logging, UUID generation
  json.hpp              # nlohmann/json (vendored)
  network/
    Server.hpp          # Template acceptor loop
    RpcServer.hpp/cpp   # JSON-RPC session handler
    PeerServer.hpp/cpp  # Inbound P2P session handler
    PeerClient.hpp/cpp  # Outbound P2P client
    PeerMessages.hpp    # Peer exchange protocol structs
    SyncMessages.hpp    # Chain sync protocol structs
    PacketHeader.hpp    # Binary packet framing
tests/                  # Catch2 test suite
```

